OL,3,AHouthi rebel advance in Yemen may
OL,4,Afurther destabilise global economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Iran-backed Houthi rebels who
OL,7,Fseized much of Yemen in 2014 have now
OL,8,Fforced the army of the internationally
OL,9,Frecognised government to withdraw from
OL,10,Fthe Red Sea coast in order to defend
OL,11,Ftheir interim capital, Aden.
OL,13,FTheir advance bodes ill for Yemen's
OL,14,Flegitimate, internationally recognised
OL,15,Fgovernment, its Saudi backers and, by
OL,16,Fextension, much of the rest of the
OL,17,Fworld.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
